  "releaseNotes": "Ported GetDuplicateNodes and GetZeroLengthBeams with complete XML IntelliSense and detached consumer examples. Preserved seed-based per-axis grouping and Euclidean endpoint-length semantics with explicit ID consistency, finite-input validation, one-pass materialization and read-only result ownership. Added scaled distance checks for extreme/subnormal coordinates. No native model changes are performed. Full release notes: https://github.com/StruXllence/StaadPro.Interop/blob/main/docs/Release-Notes.md",
